# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0 — https://citation-file-format.github.io).
# GitHub renders this as "Cite this repository"; Zenodo reads it on archive.
# The package implements two papers: cite BOTH when you use it — the CSDA 2013
# paper is `preferred-citation`, the Signal Processing 2016 paper is under
# `references`. Version and release date track the git tag (v1.1.0, 2026-09-18).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use awesomePMC in published work, please cite both papers below
  (Derrode & Pieczynski 2013 for the PMC model family and ICE-based copula
  selection; Derrode & Pieczynski 2016 for GICE, the automatic margin
  selection), and the software itself by this file.
type: software
title: awesomePMC
abstract: >-
  Pairwise and hidden Markov chains with copula-based non-Gaussian dependence
  (general pairwise Markov chains with pair-indexed margins): simulation,
  supervised MPM classification and unsupervised ICE/SEM estimation with
  automatic per-pair copula selection and GICE margin selection, standard
  errors and non-nested tests for the family choice, exact inference with
  missing observations, imputation and forecasting, image segmentation and a
  PyQt6 GUI.
authors:
  - family-names: Derrode
    given-names: Stéphane
    email: stephane.derrode@ec-lyon.fr
    affiliation: École Centrale de Lyon
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/SDerrode/awesomePMC
repository-artifact: https://pypi.org/project/awesomepmc/
url: https://github.com/SDerrode/awesomePMC
keywords:
  - copula
  - copulas
  - pairwise Markov chain
  - hidden Markov model
  - Markov chain
  - unsupervised classification
  - time series
  - time series classification
  - image segmentation
  - Bayesian inference
  - expectation maximization
  - missing data
  - imputation
  - forecasting
  - statistics
  - signal processing
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: Unsupervised data classification using pairwise Markov chains with automatic copulas selection
  authors:
    - family-names: Derrode
      given-names: Stéphane
    - family-names: Pieczynski
      given-names: Wojciech
  journal: Computational Statistics & Data Analysis
  volume: 63
  start: 81
  end: 98
  year: 2013
  doi: 10.1016/j.csda.2013.01.027
references:
  - type: article
    title: Unsupervised classification using hidden Markov chain with unknown noise copulas and margins
    authors:
      - family-names: Derrode
        given-names: Stéphane
      - family-names: Pieczynski
        given-names: Wojciech
    journal: Signal Processing
    volume: 128
    start: 8
    end: 17
    year: 2016
    doi: 10.1016/j.sigpro.2016.03.008
